{"model":"qwen3.5:35b-a3b-q4_K_M","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"You are operating autonomously inside a deterministic simulation. Preserve the mission goal and current authoritative checkpoint across the entire growing transcript. At each turn choose the single best next action from the scenario's allowed actions. Return ONLY one JSON object with keys action, checkpoint, rationale, state. action and checkpoint must be strings. rationale may be concise; state may contain your compact working state. Never declare COMPLETE before the environment says all required verification is satisfied."},{"role":"user","content":"SCENARIO repo_repair: Repair a failing repository with the smallest evidence-backed change. Preserve tests and do not declare completion before verification. Initial authoritative checkpoint=BUILD-A. Allowed actions: INSPECT, HYPOTHESIZE, TEST, PATCH, DIAGNOSE, RETEST, AUDIT, COMPLETE."},{"role":"user","content":"TURN 1/8. ENVIRONMENT: A regression report arrives. No root cause is yet established. Choose the best next autonomous action now."},{"role":"assistant","content":"{\n\"action\": \"INSPECT\",\n\"checkpoint\": \"BUILD-A\",\n\"rationale\": \"No root cause is established; inspecting the repository and regression report is required to identify the failure before hypothesizing or patching.\",\n\"state\": {\"turn\": 1, \"status\": \"initializing_investigation\", \"checkpoint\": \"BUILD-A\"}\n}"},{"role":"user","content":"TURN 2/8. ENVIRONMENT: Inspection isolates one suspicious boundary condition but has not proven causality. Choose the best next autonomous action now."},{"role":"assistant","content":"{\n\"action\": \"HYPOTHESIZE\",\n\"checkpoint\": \"BUILD-A\",\n\"rationale\": \"Inspection identified a suspicious boundary condition; formulating a specific hypothesis about its causal link to the failure is the necessary step before testing or patching.\",\n\"state\": {\"turn\": 2, \"status\": \"hypothesis_formulation\", \"checkpoint\": \"BUILD-A\", \"suspicious_area\": \"boundary_condition\"}\n}"},{"role":"user","content":"TURN 3/8. ENVIRONMENT: You have a reproducible failing fixture and must establish whether the hypothesis is real before editing. Choose the best next autonomous action now."}],"stream":true,"options":{"temperature":0.0,"seed":42,"num_predict":512},"think":false}